- op: discuss  # 1781
  at: '2026-07-02T16:52:35Z'  # 1781
  by: agent  # 1781
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 1781
  clock: 4  # 1781
  nonce: '1781'  # 1781
  message: "Done via PR #386 (merged FF). event_sourcing_linker now threads ctx.detected_frameworks -> link_events -> _scan_file -> _scan_python_events; the three Django-signal sub-scans (.send / .connect / @receiver) fire only when 'django' is in detected_frameworks (None = permissive for unit callers). Behavioral evidence (production path event_sourcing_linker, the item's filed repro): a sqlite3.connect(db) + sock.send(x) module with detected_frameworks=set() emits 0 framework='django' symbols (was 2: a sqlite3 subscriber and a sock publisher); with {'django'} a genuine post_save.connect still emits its django symbol (gate not over-tight). Mirrors the sibling django linkers' LinkerActivation(frameworks=['django']) pattern. core 100% coverage in isolation; CI passed. Sibling WI-babun is the surface-contradiction symptom; this is its producer-side root."  # 1781
